ou will notice there is and there are.","ar":"هذا الجزء الثاني، لاحظ الكمّية. ستلاحظ there is و there are."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"rana","start":12.598,"text":{"en":"Listen to these lines from the workshop, and notice there is and there are.","ar":"استمع إلى هذه الجمل من الورشة، ولاحظ there is و there are."},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"rana","start":17.556,"text":{"en":"There is a battery under the bonnet. There are two filters in the box.","ar":"هناك بطارية تحت غطاء المحرّك. هناك فلتران في الصندوق."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"rana","start":22.634,"text":{"en":"There is some oil, but there isn't much coolant.","ar":"هناك بعض الزيت، لكن ليس هناك كثير من سائل التبريد."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"rana","start":26.176,"text":{"en":"Are there any clean filters? How many hoses are there?","ar":"هل هناك أيّ فلاتر نظيفة؟ كم خرطوماً هناك؟"},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"rana","start":30.582,"text":{"en":"There is goes with one thing, or with a fluid. There are goes with more than one.","ar":"نستخدم there is مع شيء واحد أو مع سائل. ونستخدم there are مع أكثر من واحد."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"rana","start":36.188,"text":{"en":"Some is for positive sentences. Any is for questions and negative sentences.","ar":"نستخدم some في الجمل المثبتة. ونستخدم any في الأسئلة والجمل المنفية."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"rana","start":42.514,"text":{"en":"Much is for uncountable nouns, like oil and coolant.","ar":"نستخدم much مع الأسماء غير المعدودة، مثل الزيت وسائل التبريد."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"rana","start":46.896,"text":{"en":"Many is for countable nouns, like filters and hoses.","ar":"نستخدم many مع الأسماء المعدودة، مثل الفلاتر والخراطيم."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"tarek","start":51.35,"text":{"en":"Oil or filters: which one takes much?","ar":"الزيت أم الفلاتر: أيّهما يأخذ much؟"},"subHold":8.801,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"tarek","start":60.151,"text":{"en":"Oil. Oil is uncountable, so it takes much.","ar":"الزيت. الزيت غير معدود، فيأخذ much."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"rana","start":65.445,"text":{"en":"Watch out. There are much oil is wrong. Oil is uncountable, so there is much oil.","ar":"احترس. جملة There are much oil خطأ. الزيت غير معدود، فنقول There is much oil."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"rana","start":72.251,"text":{"en":"And how much filters is wrong. Filters are countable, so how many filters.","ar":"وجملة how much filters خطأ. الفلاتر معدودة، فنقول how many filters."},"id":"L014"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"8de7bf4a5083966f","bytes":35424,"sha":"c703d4edde5446a8","address":"lines/8de7bf4a5083966f.mp3"},{"key":"b3c08274cd6abe2b","bytes":33264,"sha":"57dcb101d596a547","address":"lines/b3c08274cd6abe2b.mp3"},{"key":"1152218607d7c660","bytes":27648,"sha":"ccfc9c0e40d0405a","address":"lines/1152218607d7c660.mp3"},{"key":"89061f89f2076c33","bytes":28368,"sha":"74eae2231af197ce","address":"lines/89061f89f2076c33.mp3"},{"key":"ec90a7d7b89c6310","bytes":19152,"sha":"53ccabce149225e4","address":"lines/ec90a7d7b89c6310.mp3"},{"key":"00ab76a73a5a6523","bytes":24336,"sha":"26d3c77c98ee71fb","address":"lines/00ab76a73a5a6523.mp3"},{"key":"7d37c6111b71ccdb","bytes":31536,"sha":"8df64043c71dec3b","address":"lines/7d37c6111b71ccdb.mp3"},{"key":"b5f0f482674cb507","bytes":35856,"sha":"d9c1a0a69c37c399","address":"lines/b5f0f482674cb507.mp3"},{"key":"fe3c7277babf823f","bytes":24192,"sha":"ad1561ef04ac9198","address":"lines/fe3c7277babf823f.mp3"},{"key":"85a79b17a6ed3e59","bytes":24624,"sha":"db74dbc9fb7c461a","address":"lines/85a79b17a6ed3e59.mp3"},{"key":"0638243b1f32f1a9","bytes":21744,"sha":"e205127e0255cba3","address":"lines/0638243b1f32f1a9.mp3"},{"key":"91d8a206e25a3b55","bytes":29664,"sha":"62865379d88e6556","address":"lines/91d8a206e25a3b55.mp3"},{"key":"6ca01597e70de2bf","bytes":38736,"sha":"b9ea890d7550db66","address":"lines/6ca01597e70de2bf.mp3"},{"key":"88010ef6ddb3769d","bytes":33120,"sha":"b48f0bb957283dfa","address":"lines/8801